      "parent": "refund/div.comp_container.comp_container_auto[1]/div.refundService[1]/div.refundService-content[3]/div.refundService-left[1]/div.refundNotice-content[3]/p[1]",
      "tag": "p",
      "headingLevel": null,
      "text": "自购买服务日起计算24小时内可以申请请退款（前提没有违反本站条例内容），所有产品购买超过24小时后不接受任何退款，申请退款不包括产品套餐外的其他产品或者服务，如建站服务等，(除月付以外套餐不支持退款请求！请购买月付外套餐之前测试好！)。",
      "interaction": "visible"
    },
    {
      "section": "refund",
      "order": 23,
      "parent": "refund/div.comp_container.comp_container_auto[1]/div.refundService[1]/div.refundService-content[3]/div.refundService-left[1]/div.refundNotice-content[3]/p[3]",
      "tag": "p",
      "headingLevel": null,
      "text": "备注条例：",
      "interaction": "visible"
    },
    {
      "section": "refund",
      "order": 24,
      "parent": "refund/div.comp_container.comp_container_auto[1]/div.refundService[1]/div.refundService-content[3]/div.refundService-left[1]/div.refundNotice-content[3]/p[5]",
      "tag": "p",
      "headingLevel": null,
      "text": "1:使用余额购买的产品，24小时内仅退回余额，不允许退回其他收款方式，不支持余额提现(推介计划返利除外)。请提供需要退款的账户、产品，发起工单处理。",
      "interaction": "visible"
    },
    {
      "section": "refund",
      "order": 25,
      "parent": "refund/div.comp_container.comp_container_auto[1]/div.refundService[1]/div.refundService-content[3]/div.refundService-left[1]/div.refundNotice-content[3]/p[7]",
      "tag": "p",
      "headingLevel": null,
      "text": "2:发起退款请求以后，请在规定的购买时间1天内提供收款方式，否则超过规定时间将不允许退款，在退款后我们有权删除所有的数据并且不保留任何备份。",
      "interaction": "visible"
    },
    {
      "section": "refund",
      "order": 26,
      "parent": "refund/div.comp_container.comp_container_auto[1]/div.refundService[1]/div.refundService-content[3]/div.refundService-left[1]/div.refundNotice-content[3]/p[9]",
      "tag": "p",
      "headingLevel": null,
      "text": "3:一个账户一个月内最多只能申请1次退款请求，并且不允许一个人申请多个账户，如果发现将多账户合并，超过本要求将不提供任何退款服务。",
      "interaction": "visible"
    },
    {
      "section": "refund",
      "order": 27,
      "parent": "refund/div.comp_container.comp_container_auto[1]/div.refundService[1]/div.refundService-content[3]/div.refundService-left[1]/div.refundNotice-content[3]/p[11]",
      "tag": "p",
      "headingLevel": null,
      "text": "4:VPS在两小时内流量使用超过1G并提出退款申请的的不予受理。",
      "interaction": "visible"
    },
